		"prologue.upyr": "You are a vampire",
		"prologue.human": "You are human",
		"prologue.upyr_text": "You don't know who else is like you. The street can't hurt you, and whoever ends up behind one door with you won't live till morning. By day, talk like a human.",
		"prologue.human_text": "At night outside you'll almost certainly die. You can't stay alone in a shelter: the charm goes out. You need a second person, and you don't know which of them is human.",
		"prologue.facts": "{p} villagers, {u} {u#vampire|vampires}. {s} {s#shelter|shelters} for {c} each. Survive until dawn number {n}.",
		"prologue.go": "Go out to the people",
		"prologue.elder": "You're the Elder. Once a game, by day, tap a villager and read the drawings: you'll learn whether they're a vampire. Only you will know.",
		"prologue.healer": "You're the Healer. Once a game, before night, take your herbs: if someone near you in the house is attacked, you'll nurse them back.",
